{"query":"Find exactly TEN distinct low-cost generic physical products sourced from Chinese suppliers for a Vietnamese operator selling to United States consumers through original English Instagram AI product videos. This is a shortlist for the user to select THREE, not permission to buy or publish. Exclude branded Ruffwear/Treat Trader/ChomChom and look across home organization, cleaning tools, simple kitchen accessories, desk/travel organizers, and non-medical pet accessories. Prefer simple observable use, unbranded products, low weight and breakage, low unit cost and low MOQ. Open actual specific Chinese supplier product listings (Alibaba, Made-in-China, 1688, AliExpress or credible manufacturer), not just category/search pages. Do not use US branded retail prices as wholesale costs. Verify country from the supplier page, otherwise mark unknown. Record the actual quoted unit price or minimum tier in cost ONLY if seen, state MOQ/tier/currency, whether single-unit dropshipping is verified, and the observed date in evidenceNotes. shipping must remain null unless verified for a US destination; price is a proposed retail TEST price (roughly 3–4x unit cost only if plausible), explicitly labelled hypothetical in risks. All summaries/evidence/risks should be concise Vietnamese; keep product names and proposed content hooks in English. contentAngle: one specific English visual hook and why product suits a short AI-video test; never invent a real demonstration, sales performance or viral score. evidenceUrl may be a verified comparable US listing but never call it demand proof. In evidenceNotes include IMAGE_URL only when an actual product image URL is visible in the supplier listing. Do not fabricate URLs, price, review counts, sales, MOQ, availability or proof you opened a blocked page. If blocked, try a different reliable listing. Ten distinct usable choices is the target; report honestly fewer if inaccessible, with blockers. Keep each candidates evidenceNotes/risks under 600 characters and contentAngle under 240 characters. Return exactly the requested JSON shape and no markdown.","market":"United States","locale":"en-US","remainingSlots":10,"existing":[],"date":"2026-11-11"}

